    "text": "Let f be an inner screen of a saturated formation F and suppose that a finite\ngroup A acts faithfully and f -hypercentrally on a finite group G. Is it true that\nG ⋊ A ∈ F for all G ∈ F if and only if F is a Fitting class?               W. Guo",
